e":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"似误。○石固镇，在州西北五十里，西通密县诸山，商贾辏集于...","context_before":"...亭[在州西北二十八里。亦曰岸门，今名长武亭。《括地志》：","source_end_index":47,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e76581aa-6ebc-5c78-b0e7-fa4ca284fa70","source_start_index":30,"source_text":"战国时，秦人败韩于岸门，即此处也。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","外交"],"content":"2魏人叛秦。秦人伐魏，取曲沃而歸其人。又敗韓於岸門，韓太子倉入質于秦以和。","content_fanyi":"魏人背叛秦国。秦人讨伐魏国，夺取曲沃后归还了当地的百姓。又在岸门击败韩国，韩国太子仓到秦国做人质来求和。","content_jianti_auto":"2魏人叛秦。秦人伐魏，取曲沃而归其人。又败韩于岸门，韩太子仓入质于秦以和。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":237,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c627607-db0e-11ef-9324-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c627625-db0e-11ef-82ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c627626-db0e-11ef-becd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"退齋","people_name_jianti_auto":"退斋","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c627627-db0e-11ef-8a9c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「國」下有「雖小」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退齋校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「国」下有「虽小」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退斋校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c627624-db0e-11ef-9564-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8c627623-db0e-11ef-8bb7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"平","people_name_jianti_auto":"平","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c627629-db0e-11ef-8acf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"子之","people_name_jianti_auto":"子之","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8c62762a-db0e-11ef-87d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"平","people_name_jianti_auto":"平","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8c62762b-db0e-11ef-b932-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"噲","people_name_jianti_auto":"哙","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"8c62762c-db0e-11ef-b181-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"飭，整也，修也，治也。治，直之翻。飭君臣之義，言太子平將治子之僭王之罪也。明父子之位，言太子平當繼其父噲之位也。令，力政翻，命令也，號令也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"饬，整也，修也，治也。治，直之翻。饬君臣之义，言太子平将治子之僭王之罪也。明父子之位，言太子平当继其父哙之位也。令，力政翻，命令也，号令也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"8c627628-db0e-11ef-aa1e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"北地","place_name_jianti_auto":"北地","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8c627631-db0e-11ef-aa1c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c627632-db0e-11ef-94de-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c627633-db0e-11ef-af81-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"千乘","place_name_jianti_auto":"千乘","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8c627634-db0e-11ef-9cae-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"清河","place_name_jianti_auto":"清河","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8c627635-db0e-11ef-bbdb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"勃海","place_name_jianti_auto":"勃海","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8c627636-db0e-11ef-b40b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"將，卽亮翻，又音如字，領也。邑有先王之廟曰都。或曰：都，邑之大者。北地，齊之北境也，蓋漢千乘、清河、勃海之地。燕，因肩翻；下同。乘，繩證翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"将，即亮翻，又音如字，领也。邑有先王之庙曰都。或曰：都，邑之大者。北地，齐之北境也，盖汉千乘、清河、勃海之地。燕，因肩翻；下同。乘，绳证翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"8c627630-db0e-11ef-81ec-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"將軍","official_note":"將軍是古代軍事指揮官，此處指市被擔任將軍職務，參與燕國內亂。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"將軍市被與太子平謀攻子之","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"10c3069c-0541-4412-a331-55657f514b1e"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"齊王","official_note":"齊王是齊國的君主，此處指齊王參與燕國內政，支持太子平。","official_rank":"王","source_snippet":"齊王令人謂太子曰","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"21927457-1aa0-4887-bff6-78ee56c1e00b"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"太子","official_note":"太子是王位繼承人，此處指燕國太子平，在內亂中謀攻子之。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"太子因要黨聚衆","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"fb0c4274-59f4-42e0-8738-5b272a865a86"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"章子","official_note":"章子在此處被任命為將領，率領齊國軍隊伐燕，是軍事指揮官。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"齊王令章子將五都之兵","start_index":108,"tongjian_id":"b49eb7dd-97de-4610-8456-5ad347d27e33"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"燕王","official_note":"燕王是燕國的君主，此處指燕王噲，在齊國伐燕後被殺。","official_rank":"王","source_snippet":"遂殺燕王噲","start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"70d1a722-a62a-424f-9b6f-54a992d8e56a"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-314,"link_td_description":"燕王子之，战国时曾任燕王哙的国相，后获禅让成为燕王。在位第三年时国内动荡，齐国军队趁虚而入发兵攻燕，子之被杀并剁成肉酱。","link_td_id":"Q10009038","link_td_number_id":505348,"people_name":"子之","people_name_jianti_auto":"子之","people_xingming":"子之","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c636622-db0e-11ef-ae32-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"市被","people_name_jianti_auto":"市被","people_xingming":"市被","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8c636623-db0e-11ef-a44d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"平","people_name_jianti_auto":"平","people_xingming":"姬平","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c636624-db0e-11ef-9267-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-314,"link_td_description":"燕王子之，战国时曾任燕王哙的国相，后获禅让成为燕王。在位第三年时国内动荡，齐国军队趁虚而入发兵攻燕，子之被杀并剁成肉酱。","link